<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal to keep 25 pct of Telecom.</title>
<headline>Portugal to keep 25 pct of Telecom.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The state will keep a direct or indirect stake of least 25 percent in Portugal Telecom until January 1, 2000, the date when the Portuguese market will be opened up fully to competition, according to a draft law published on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The state currently has a 51 percent stake and an act of parliament is needed for it to go below 50 percent. ((  --Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035 ))</p>
</text>
